Description: |
  The step cache of prettyplay: one verbatim normalization of addressing texts (the rendered sentence; NFC + trim), deterministic addressing by the addressing text, the step scope (the shared cache namespace, the scoped routing, the two validation rings), atomic repository storage, the per-test working-set lifecycle — touched-address accumulation and the close-time sweep — and the per-test attempt budgets, the group recovery cycle accounting.
